{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：12:15 2026-10-18 HKT</p>\n<p>Sunny@Supper Moment和連詩雅（Shiga）接受訪問，他們表示當晚會為對方唱和音，和唱對方的歌曲。Sunny表示，雖然是唱為她創作的新歌，但因年代久遠，所以練習要重新記憶當中的細節。連詩雅透露，老公陳家樂亦十分喜愛band sound，在家時更叫老公唱主音，讓她可以練習，「我好緊張呢個和音。」</p>\n<h2>Sunny兒子喜愛AC/DC</h2>\n<p>Sunny透露4歲兒子喜歡聽外國樂隊AC/DC。連詩雅透露想女兒學結他打鼓：「女仔彈結他好型！」會不會想生多個夾band？連詩雅回答：「咁快？！」Sunny也表示，想和同場的羅志祥（小豬）合作：「陣間問吓先。」</p>\n<img alt=\"Sunny透露4歲兒子喜歡聽外國樂隊AC/DC。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/ccd88d0503ce5582a660d36a6c912294/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-17_at_23_30_49.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"連詩雅透露在家時叫老公唱主音，讓她可以練習。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/d98f42ac574b8f6e58fc16a505af2003/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-17_at_23_30_50_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Sunny想和同場的羅志祥（小豬）合作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/dd050fec2016d0001881a28aa95ebeef/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-17_at_23_30_50.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\" Sunny@Supper Moment和連詩雅（Shiga）表示當晚會為對方唱和音，和唱對方的歌曲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/7dea37dad0c366da78cbd72393b90116/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-17_at_23_30_51_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"連詩雅透露想女兒學結他打鼓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/109e4bb8a625cd3292ad929da2f48bbb/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-17_at_23_30_51.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Sunny說雖然是唱為她創作的新歌，但因年代久遠，所以練習要重新記憶當中的細節。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/b37f4afcdf2c9659be0b6b0f8446d641/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-17_at_23_30_52.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"連詩雅亦好緊張呢個和音。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/c0e94fad00e2e963f58a36dafaece999/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-17_at_23_30_53_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"連詩雅透露，老公陳家樂亦十分喜愛band sound，在家時更叫老公唱主音，讓她可以練習\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ll/sthl/eee898c5840249f093a538ef28637f47/2026-10/Z01_2.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T04:38:39.796708+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":302,"images":8,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T04:15:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T09:57:51.170780+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T04:37:34.447449+00:00","content_hash":"93812e5ee0cec98904b787baad4aed33c80ed6187becf6dfc40a9845ea1eb7ea","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}